  <p id="c-nanshi-047-jin076-yuxiaofu:kin" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-047-jin076-yuxiaofu:kin:m0000" ref="lo2_l7i_fa4">虞悰</persName>字<persName id="c-nanshi-047-jin076-yuxiaofu:kin:m0003" ref="lo2_l7i_fa4">景豫</persName>，會稽余姚人也。祖<persName id="c-nanshi-047-jin076-yuxiaofu:kin:m0014" ref="a6e_72c_a59">嘯父</persName>，晉左戶尚書。父<persName id="c-nanshi-047-jin076-yuxiaofu:kin:m0024" ref="add_0d9_001">秀之</persName>，黃門郎。</p>
